      "source": "Combined <a href=\"EntityReader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>EntityReader</code></a> and <a href=\"EntityWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>EntityWriter</code></a> and add the ability to access a <a href=\"../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> and\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a>.",
      "translation": "合并了 <a href=\"EntityReader.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>EntityReader</code></a> 和 <a href=\"EntityWriter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>EntityWriter</code></a>，并增加了对 <a href=\"../mapping/context/MappingContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping.context\"><code>MappingContext</code></a> 以及\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/ConversionService.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert\"><code>ConversionService</code></a> 的访问能力。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span id=\"type-param-E\"><code>E</code> - the concrete <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> implementation the converter is based on.</span>",
      "translation": "<span id=\"type-param-E\"><code>E</code> - 转换器所基于的具体<a href=\"../mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>实现。</span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span id=\"type-param-P\"><code>P</code> - the concrete <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> implementation the converter is based on.</span>",
      "translation": "<span id=\"type-param-P\"><code>P</code> - 转换器所基于的具体<a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>实现。</span>",
      "count": 1
